# Cloudflare Pages response headers (copied into dist/ by Vite).
# Cross-origin isolation lets stem separation use several CPU threads, but it
# blocks the YouTube player, so YouTube mode (/youtube/) is served without it.
# The dev server does the same in vite.config.ts.

/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp

/youtube/*
  ! Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy
  ! Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy
